      "description": "Recessed panel that distinguishes frontend, backend, and storage.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-architecture\"><h3>Arquitectura</h3><dl><div><dt>Frontend</dt><dd>React</dd></div><div><dt>Backend</dt><dd>Django</dd></div><div><dt>Base de datos</dt><dd>MariaDB</dd></div></dl></section>",
      "css": ".ds-architecture{background:var(--color-surface-card);border:1px solid var(--color-border-primary);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;color:var(--color-text-bright);font-family:var(--font-sans)}.ds-architecture h3{margin:0;padding:20px 24px;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-text-muted);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border-primary)}.ds-architecture dl{margin:0;padding:8px 24px}.ds-architecture dl div{padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border-primary)}.ds-architecture dl div:last-child{border:0}.ds-architecture dt{font:.75rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-text-muted)}.ds-architecture dd{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.02em}"
